# game1's window headless: the start menu over the circling view of the map, the practice against seven bots (a
# server in this process), walking and shooting under the pointer lock a headless run plays (locked at once, `motion`
# for the mouse, Esc lets it go), the pause menu, back to the start; a shot of the game in between.  The settings of a
# scripted run live in mem:// (the person's own are never read or written).
expect text:"Ein schneller Cartoon-Shooter, jeder gegen jeden." exists
expect "Raum erstellen" exists
click "Üben gegen Bots"
expect text:"Ein schneller Cartoon-Shooter, jeder gegen jeden." missing
wait 1500
keydown w code 26
wait 400
keyup w code 26
motion 400 -60
down canvas:"Spiel"
wait 300
up canvas:"Spiel"
wait 200
shot build/game1_play.png
key esc
expect "Raum verlassen" exists
expect "Weiterspielen" exists
click "Raum verlassen"
expect text:"Ein schneller Cartoon-Shooter, jeder gegen jeden." exists
